\newlabel{tab:appendix_concordance_model_ranking}{{8}{10}{\textbf {Model-level concordance ranking on the shared 623-origin subset.} We report each model's average pairwise Jaccard agreement with all other labelers and Jaccard agreement with human trainee majority-vote high-sentence sets. SR = self-reported labels; CC = ContextCite top-$K$ labels}{table.caption.12}{}}
